# BOOT WITH ADDON of Hello.gba with RESET on: as the launch starts on its
# addons, the loading card shows the game's name and "Loading the game",
# which it keeps through the quick checks (save states, patches): they move
# the bar and are only logged (source/progress.h). The other switches'
# slots are erased, and its log line says they are off (v0.3.2: 65535, the
# erased slot's value).
#! settings 1=1
-w "screen ready: sd-list"
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @16:DOWN -k @20:- -k @24:DOWN -k @28:- -k @32:DOWN -k @36:-
-k @44:A -k @48:-
-w "screen ready: file-menu"
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "BOOT WITH ADDON: reset 1, savestate 0, sleep 0, cheats 0 "
-s @0:addons.png
